            + "many items there are, once an `ItemsProvider` has answered."),
        new("Nav menu", "Its navigation landmark's name, or none for the only one shown",
            "`NavMenu(name).FollowAsync(path)` opens the closed groups named before a link once the page is "
            + "interactive, waiting for each group's `ExpandedChanged`, then follows the link; `CurrentAsync()` reads "
            + "the current page's link. `ExpandAsync(path)` opens the groups on a path and `CollapseAsync(path)` "
            + "closes the last one, each waiting for `ExpandedChanged`; `ExpandedAsync(path)` reads whether the last "
            + "one is open."),
        new("Insert divider", "Its Label", "`InsertDivider(label).InsertAsync()` presses its insert button once the "
            + "page is interactive."),
        new("Toolbar", "Its AriaLabel, or none for the only one", "`Toolbar(name).ClickAsync(button)` clicks a "
            + "button by its name once the toolbar has fitted its buttons, after a resize too, choosing it from the "
            + "overflow menu when it has moved there."),
        new("Toast", "Its text", "`Toasts.WaitForAsync(text)` finds it once it shows, `DismissAsync(text)` closes "
            + "it, and `ChooseAsync(text, action)` clicks its action and waits until the app has run it."),
    ];

